  "economy.diagram.desc": "Waddada guusha: ciyaar ciyaaro, hel lacagta ciyaarta. Waddada iibsiga: lacag dhab ah ayaa iibisa lacagta ciyaarta. Labada waddo waxay u horseedaan isla meel: maraakiib, hagaajinta markabka iyo qurxin, kadibna dib ugu noqo ciyaaraha. La qorsheeyay, lama dhisin.",
