  "economy.todayHead": "Waxa maanta jira",
  "economy.todayLead": "Heerarka jidhka iyo gaashaanka iyo midabbada gaashaanka ee shaashadda LOADOUT (0.6.0) waxay muujinayaan nooca hagaajinta iyo qurxinta ee dhaqaalaha loogu talagalay inuu bixiyo.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Maxaa yeelay dakhligeedu waa in lagu bixiyo. Ciyaartu waxay ku bilaabmaysaa gebi ahaanba AI sameeyay si ay u jirto; naqshadeeyayaasha la bixiyo ayaa kadib beddela shaqada AI, iyagoo magacyadooda lagu sheegayo.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Ma ku ciyaari karaa khadka?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Ma lacag la'aan ayaa loo ciyaaraa?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Su'aalo",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Weli maya. Ciyaarta badan ee LAN ee isla shabakadda maanta way shaqeysaa (min 0.2.0); ciyaarta khadka lama dhisin.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Prototype-ka waxaa lagu dhisay matoorka ilaha furan ee Quake III Arena (GPL) wuxuuna ka qaatay maraakiibta Elite Dangerous dhiirigelin ahaan. Maalinta labaad koodhka ciyaarta wuxuu u wareegay BuB, matoor cusub oo lagu qoray Claude Code; qaybaha ciyaarta waxay ka yimaadeen prototype-ka oo magacyadooda la beddelay. Nooca 0.3.0 wuxuu siiyay dhammaan 16-ka nooc ee markab jidhyo cusub. Dib u eegis u hoggaansanaanta shatiga ayaa hubinaysa in koodh kasta uu weli ka soo jeedo asalka GPL iyo in naqshadaha hore ee maraakiibtu aad ugu dhow yihiin dhiirigelintooda. Baaritaan otomaatig ah oo isbarbardhig ah oo koodhka lagula barbardhigay isha prototype-ka GPL ayaa dhacay <0/>, dib u eegista khubarada ee isku-halaysyadiisuna way socotaa. Wax kasta oo laga soo qaatay waa dib loo qori doonaa ama dib loo naqshadayn doonaa. Ilaa dib u eegistu dhammaato, ma sheegno in jawaabtu tahay maya.",
  "faq.questions": "Su'aalo",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Maraakiib, farshaxan, is-dhexgal iyo wax kale, marka dakhligu oggolaado. <0>Diiwaanka bogga ku jira<\/0> wuxuu taxayaa qayb kasta wuxuuna muujin doonaa beddel kasta iyo naqshadeeyihiisa.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Maraakiibta iyo hagaajinta waxaa la qorsheeyay in la heli karo ciyaarid ama la iibsan karo. Sida maraakiibta lacagta lagu bixiyo ay uga sii ahaanayaan cadaalad ciyaaryahan-ka-dhan-ciyaaryahan weli waa la naqshadaynayaa.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Taasi waa qorshaha: lacag la'aan ayaa loo ciyaaraa oo leh lacag ciyaarta ah oo ikhtiyaari ah iyo qurxin. Weli lama dhisin.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Ma la guuriyay shaqada qof?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Goorma ayay soo baxaysaa, maxayse ku soo baxaysaa?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Qaybaha dadku beddeli doonaan, sidee baan ku ogaan doonaa?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Maxaa ciyaar AI sameeyay naqshadeeyayaasha u caawinaysaa?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Ma noqon doontaa lacag bixi si aad ugu guuleysato?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Taariikh sii daynta iyo qiimo weli ma jiraan.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude iyo Claude Code waa calaamado ganacsi oo Anthropic, PBC ah. Unreal Engine iyo Epic Games waa calaamado ganacsi oo Epic Games, Inc. ah. Blender waa calaamad ganacsi oo Blender Foundation ah. Quake III Arena iyo Elite Dangerous waa calaamado ganacsi oo milkiilayaashooda ah. Dhammaan magacyadu waxay ka tirsan yihiin milkiilayaashooda waxaana loo isticmaalaa oo keliya in lagu garto alaabta la sheegay. Orion-81 kuma xidhna, ma kafaalaqaadin, mana taageerin mid ka mid ah iyaga.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Rajo. Wada shaqeyn, xidhiidh ama taageero ma jirto.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Kanaal ayaa imaanaya",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Devlog YouTube ku jira",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "La soco Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Lamaane mustaqbal?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Raadraac ma jiro. Cookies ma jiro. Bog hordhac ah. Xaqiiqo kasta waxay ku soo laabataa kaydka mashruuca; wax halkan ah ma aha dalab ama ballanqaad.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Weli ma socdo",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Hal shay ayaa weli furan: <0>dib u eegista shatiga<\/0> koodhka ciyaarta ee ka yimid prototype-ka GPL. Baaritaan otomaatig ah oo isbarbardhig ah oo koodhka lagula barbardhigay isha prototype-ka ayaa dhacay <1/>, dib u eegista khubarada ee isku-halaysyadiisuna way socotaa.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 waa mashruuc gebi ahaanba AI soo saartay.<\/0> Koodhka Orion-81 laftiisa waxaa qoray Claude Code, aasaasuhu hago; maraakiibta, khaaraddada, muuqaallada dusha iyo dhawaaqyada waxaa soo saaray qalab Claude Code qoray. Maktabadaha ilaha furan ee uu isticmaalo waxay ku taxan yihiin <1>'Aan AI sameynin'<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Cidhifka bogga",
  "hero.behindThisPlate": "Gadaasha sawirkan: moodelka ORION-1 ee ciyaarta ee nooca 0.6.1, oo si toos ah ugu muuqda browser-kaaga (loogu beddelay shabakadda, muuqaalka dusha hoos loo dhigay 512 px).",
  "hero.behindThisPlate2": "Gadaasha sawirkan: sawir ka yimid ciyaarta ee nooca 0.6.1. 3D-ga isdhexgalka waa damsan yahay qalabkan.",
  "hero.exploreShips": "Baar maraakiibta",
  "hero.followKickstarter": "La soco Kickstarter",
  "hero.groundedSixDegrees": "Dagaal bannaan oo dhulka ku dhow oo lix darajo xorriyad leh, laga bilaabo dagaalyahan 12 m ah ilaa markab hoggaamiye ah oo 1.2 km ah.",
  "hero.n100AiGenerated": "100 % AI SOO SAARTAY  ·  0 % BINI-AADAM SAMEEYAY ILAA HADDA",
  "hero.notLiveYet": "Weli ma socdo",
  "hero.oneItemStill": "Hal shay ayaa weli furan oo si cad loo muujiyay: <0>dib u eegista shatiga koodhka ciyaarta ee ka yimid prototype-ka GPL<\/0>.",
  "hero.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 waa mashruuc gebi ahaanba AI soo saartay.<\/0> <1>Sida loo sameeyay<\/1>",
